# Sprint Workflow

Active sprint: [Sprint3.md](../../docs/07-Sprint-Planning/Sprint3.md)

## Task ownership

| Prefix | Owner |
|:-------|:------|
| `H*` | Hoàng |
| `T*` | Hưng |
| `V*` | Hiếu |

**Exception (Sprint 3):** `T52a–d` → **Hoàng** — see [Sprint3.md](../../docs/07-Sprint-Planning/Sprint3.md) and [stories/T52.md](../../docs/07-Sprint-Planning/stories/T52.md).

## Before starting a task

1. Check task status and dependencies in Sprint3.md
2. Read story packet if exists: `docs/07-Sprint-Planning/stories/<TASK-ID>.md`
3. Confirm "Do not touch" scope — avoid cross-owner conflicts

## Branch and commit

- Branch: `feature/<task-id>-<short-name>` (e.g. `feature/H48-chatbot-core`)
- Commits: conventional prefixes (`feat:`, `fix:`, `docs:`, `test:`, `chore:`)

## Done criteria

- Copy "Done when" from Sprint3.md or story packet
- Run verify command listed in story packet
- Update task checkbox in Sprint3.md when complete

## Gate G3 priority (until 25/06)

Deliverables G3-1 through G3-5 take precedence over carry-over P2 tasks.
